  "implemented": [
    "Complete immutable first-plan candidate including no-op intent and exact SDK wire; stable input vs generated artifacts separated",
    "Host schema44 business-operation results, guarded original-root binding, single-use in-memory authority and bounded expiry fencing",
    "Fresh read validation of canonical metadata, result hashes, exact binding and UTC audit timestamps; no constructor DDL or network",
    "No scanning publication, business replay or automatic reacquisition of known operations",
    "Joint SDK/business guard and typed first results in the original root; durable no-op version protection; authoritative abort competes the same row",
    "Typed role/resource/grant/assignment projections restore first ID/time/result without new execution",
    "Optional REST Idempotency-Key, generated operation reference headers and authenticated original-principal/current-original-permissions query",
    "Schema44 journal explicitly composed by transaction owner; permission versions read at fresh primary boundary; org claims do not open scoped service receipts",
    "Query capacity and actual tasks joined on close; synchronous bounded business maintenance shares owner scan budget with SDK (default50+50 per5s)",
    "All five maintenance CLI writers use public operation-result projections without copying private before/after snapshots; CLI cross-invocation keys explicitly refused"
  ],
